{"ref":"BDB, חֲצַר שׁוּעָל","hw":"חֲצַר שׁוּעָל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצַר שׁוּעָל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  place in southern Judah <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:28\" href=\"/Joshua.15.28\">Jos 15:28</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.28\">1 Ch 4:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:27\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.27\">Ne 11:27</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  place in Simeon <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:3\" href=\"/Joshua.19.3\">Jos 19:3</a>.—𝔊 Αρσωλα, Χολασεωλα, Ασαρσουλα, Ασαρσουαρ, etc.","next":"BDB, חָצֵר הַתִּיכוֹן","prev":"BDB, חֲצַר עֵינוֹן"}